        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Note**: The compliance aspect is implicitly covered by the broader safety and compliance phrase, and the fact **e_00ed60** serves as supporting evidence that the operator also meets compliance criteria, though it is not explicitly listed in the JSON due to the single-item-per-condition rule.

